Description: Project the development of the population at different spatial levels 
    (e.g., cantons, districts, municipalities) using the cohort component method, 
    broken down by 101 one-year age classes, gender, and nationality. Includes helper 
    functions to download required population data and projection parameters as 
    open data for Switzerland, plus tools for model evaluation against benchmarks such 
    as population records or a base model.
URL: https://statistik-aargau.github.io/propop, https://statistik-aargau.github.io/propop/
